    },
    "Cleeth" : {

    },
    "Cleeth does not collect any data or Device’s Brushing Preferences for the correct functionality of the Cleeth App, stored locally and never leaving the device. Therefore, nothing is sold or shared with third parties." : {

    },
    "Cleeth will create a Reminder for each time of the day you set to be reminded to Brush your Teeth on the Reminders App (1 month).\n\nNote: Previous Events set up by Cleeth will be Deleted and Replaced with the new configuration." : {

    },
    "Cleeth will create Events for each time of the day you set to be reminded to Brush your Teeth on your Calendar (1 month).\n\nNote: Previous Events set up by Cleeth will be Deleted and Replaced with the new configuration." : {

